O</given-names></name><name><surname>Sorgenfrei</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Klopprogge</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Heinzle</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Wittmann</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>In-depth profiling of lysine-producing <italic>Corynebacterium glutamicum </italic>by combined analysis of the transcriptome, metabolome, and fluxome</article-title><source>J Bacteriol</source><year>2004</year><volume>186</volume><fpage>1769</fpage><lpage>1784</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14996808</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1128/JB.186.6.1769-1784.2004</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Schwender</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Ohlrogge</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Shachar-Hill</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Understanding flux in plant metabolic networks</article-title><source>Curr Opin Plant Biol</source><year>2004</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>309</fpage><lpage>317</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15134752</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.pbi.2004.03.016</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wittmann</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Kim</surname><given-names>HM</given-names></name><name><surname>Heinzle</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Metabolic network analysis of lysine producing Corynebacterium glutamicum at a miniaturized scale</article-title><source>Biotechnol Bioeng</source><year>2004</year><volume>87</volume><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>6</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15211482</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/bit.20103</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"